{"id":"bb808e04195f2bc5","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-hamiltonian-cycle.md","title":"HAMILTONIAN-CYCLE","display":"df-hamiltonian-cycle — HAMILTONIAN-CYCLE","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-hamiltonian-cycle","aliases":["28-df-hamiltonian-cycle","HAMILTONIAN-CYCLE"],"display":"df-hamiltonian-cycle — HAMILTONIAN-CYCLE","depends_on":["[[28-df-finite-graph]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-hamiltonian-cycle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-hamiltonian-cycle</span><span>HAMILTONIAN-CYCLE</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hamiltonian-cycle — HAMILTONIAN-CYCLE"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dada5c223e508373\" href=\"?note=dada5c223e508373\" title=\"28-df-finite-graph\">28-df-finite-graph</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UGraph}\">\\(\\mathrm{UGraph}\\)</span> 与单射图编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dada5c223e508373\" href=\"?note=dada5c223e508373\" title=\"28-df-finite-graph\">28-df-finite-graph</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{HC}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{HC}}\\)</span> 由下式指定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[m]=\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\">\\([m]=\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\)</span>；简单无向环按长度至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3\">\\(3\\)</span> 计。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{HC}}(G)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}(G)\\qquad(G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{HC}}(G)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}(G)\\qquad(G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HC}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{HC}}(G)\\ \\middle|\\\nG=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\land|V|\\ge3\\land\n\\exists v:[|V|]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}V\\;\n\\left(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|V|-1\\}\\;\\{v(i),v(i+1)\\}\\in E\\land\\{v(|V|),v(1)\\}\\in E\\right)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HC}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{HC}}(G)\\ \\middle|\\\nG=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\land|V|\\ge3\\land\n\\exists v:[|V|]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}V\\;\n\\left(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|V|-1\\}\\;\\{v(i),v(i+1)\\}\\in E\\land\\{v(|V|),v(1)\\}\\in E\\right)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>双射保证每个顶点恰访问一次。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\ge3\">\\(m\\ge3\\)</span> 排除把同一无向边来回走算作二顶点简单环，以及空图中的未绑定端点。</p>\n<p>来源核对：习题2.18；印刷65页；PDF91页。简单环措辞已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-finite-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dada5c223e508373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-finite-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-finite-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dada5c223e508373","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UGraph}$ 与单射图编码 $\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}$ 见 [[28-df-finite-graph]]；$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{HC}}$ 由下式指定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{UGraph}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{HC}}","display":false},{"tex":"[m]=\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}","display":false},{"tex":"3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{HC}}(G)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{UG}}(G)\\qquad(G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HC}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{HC}}(G)\\ \\middle|\\\nG=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\land|V|\\ge3\\land\n\\exists v:[|V|]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}V\\;\n\\left(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|V|-1\\}\\;\\{v(i),v(i+1)\\}\\in E\\land\\{v(|V|),v(1)\\}\\in E\\right)\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"m\\ge3","display":false}],"bytes":1203,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"图问题：[[28-df-finite-graph]]、[[28-df-clique]]、[[28-df-vertex-cover]]、[[28-df-independent-set]]、[[28-df-hamiltonian-cycle]]、[[28-df-graph-coloring]]、[[28-df-set-cover]]。"},{"id":"a4c4ae3ab0ef3bfc","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["dada5c223e508373"]}